# Netlify redirect rules for inspectionmuse.com

# Force HTTPS - redirect HTTP to HTTPS
http://inspectionmuse.com/* https://inspectionmuse.com/:splat 301!
http://www.inspectionmuse.com/* https://inspectionmuse.com/:splat 301!

# Redirect www to non-www (HTTPS)
https://www.inspectionmuse.com/* https://inspectionmuse.com/:splat 301!

# Catch-all for any other domains pointing to this site
http://*/* https://inspectionmuse.com/:splat 301!